---
title: Devil's Food Cake
author: Edna Wilkins
category: Desserts
cook time: 30 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@shortening{0.5%cup}
@sugar{1.5%cups}
@cocoa{0.5%cup}
@eggs{2}
@boiling water{1%cup}
@flour{2%cups}
@baking soda{2%tsp}
@vanilla{1%tsp}
@sour milk{0.5%cup}

Mix and bake at 350 degrees until done - about 30 minutes.
